notes.content:
Main changes:
Added import and export functionality to the Quick Switch tool window;
The import function can be accessed by clicking on 'Add Functionality' or by directly dragging the export file into the Quick Switch tool window;
You can quickly and conveniently share your work scripts with others for direct use, improving work efficiency.


Other changes:
1.Adjusted the logic of software button arrangement, reducing the displayed data on each row of buttons when more buttons are hidden;
2.Clicking in the Quick Switch toolbar will no longer trigger the drag effect unintentionally;
3.ChartGPT is almost complete, but I found it is being blocked by the Key. Using my own Key leads to Key failure, and the interaction effect is not very good. I need to think about this carefully.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42494895/7bafaf84d674f88a763cdbb4a76a02367194beff.gif[/img]

[list]
[*]Prompt for optimization when the quick switch setting window is not saved, and the text of the "Apply" button is changed to "Save";
[*]The quick switching settings window, puzzle game window, and creative workshop window are no longer on the top, and have their own independent taskbar window;
[/list]

