notes.content:
Added Todo List Feature, it can
[list]
[*] Add items with priority and automatically sort items;
[*] Manually drag items to change priority;
[*] What has been done is reviewed by day;
[*] The things that have been done are summarized and archived by month (directory: %appdata%\QuickMatrix\DoneList);
[*] Shortcut keys reuse the previous Ctrl+F1;
[/list]
They are tools that are convenient for working,
hope you like it,
Thanks for the support! ! !

