[list]
[*]Add disable system scaling function, it is enabled by default;
[*]Fix the problem that the game interface does not display when the jigsaw puzzle game starts for the second time;
[/list]

[list]
[*]When right-clicking a button, the popup menu adds <hide> function;
[*]When right-clicking the background or the title, the popup menu adds the <Show hidden button> function;
[/list]

[list]
[*]Add the chose file or folder buttons when press <New Button> button and open URL setting dialog;
[*]Fixed a crash that may occur when selecting Exe as a picture;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42494895/58d5e91a87a223806ea7e19efe18df38e45a5894.jpg[/img]

[list]
[*]Add the close and minimize function to the Puzzle game;
[*]Fix a possible puzzle game crash;
[/list]

[list]
[*]Increase the startup speed, when you can start offline, you don't have to wait for the running Steam to respond;
[*]Add Spanish language support;
[*]Fix a possible crash;
[/list]

[list]
[*]Fixed an issue where the program would crash when the number of buttons was less than the number of buttons in a single row;
[*]Fix the problem that the new picture cannot be displayed after start the puzzle game;
[/list]

Thanks to user "Sunny C" for the reminder

[list]
[*]Fix the problem that the interface is not visible after the new user directly hides the function button;
[*]Adjust the default window position for new users to the upper right corner;
[*]When the user does not add any entry, a prompt window is displayed to teach the user to use it;
[*]Add Russian language in app languages settings;
[/list]

[list]
[*]The search window can be displayed and closed independently through hotkeys, and a close button is added to the search window;
[*]Button layout calculation algorithm optimization;
[/list]

[list]
[*] When the display resolution is changed, the client dialog can adapt to its own position, and the problem that the window cannot be dragged back outside the display will no longer occur;
[/list]

[list]
[*] Optimized the logic of double-line display in large button;
[*] Optimized the display of more characters when the text is pure Latin characters;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42494895/f45f8ecb5dffe3d285513dc1360ce90460223274.jpg[/img]

[list]
[*]Adding the function of large button, the layout will be automatically adjusted according to the current button, so some positions cannot be dragged with large button, switch the large button Settings->Button;
[*]The minimum number of buttons in each row is changed to 3;
[*]The maximum limit of button text is changed to 9 characters, and it still only displays 4 characters when it is a small icon;
[*]Fixed the problem that the text setting does not disappear when the button in the settings is switched to the icon style;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42494895/383e3ee2a88209508abc27466e1694f4d2bec022.jpg[/img]

New Feature:
Now the button supports links, you can configure any URL in it, even the Steam protocol to launch the game;
Added a switch to control whether to display the tooltip, which is turned on by default and can be turned off in the settings;

BUG fix:
Fixed the bug that the setting page was closed directly when press accept;
